SetAllowed_YieldRegistry_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when vault zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when yieldVault zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   └── when both non zero
      ├── given allowed true
      │  ├── given no prior entry
      │  │  ├── it should set the entry
      │  │  └── it should emit VaultAllowed true
      │  └── given prior entry true
      │     └── it should be idempotent
      └── given allowed false
         ├── given prior entry true
         │  ├── it should clear the entry
         │  └── it should emit VaultAllowed false
         └── given no prior entry
            └── it should emit VaultAllowed false
